{"title": "Lute of the Merryweather Bard", "pageid": 12072, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lute_of_the_Merryweather_Bard", "categories": ["Musical Instruments", "Common items", "Divinity references"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Icon.png/300px-Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/7/7f/Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Lute of the Merryweather Bard image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Icon.png/300px-Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Lute of the Merryweather Bard</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Instrument\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Instrument\">instrument</a> that can be played using the <a href=\"/wiki/Perform\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Perform\">Perform</a> action.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span