n.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">35a38ec0-8902-46bf-ae84-f2361e713b7e</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:35a38ec0-8902-46bf-ae84-f2361e713b7e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:35a38ec0-8902-46bf-ae84-f2361e713b7e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lute)\" title=\"Perform (Lute)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/80px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform (Lute)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lute)\" title=\"Perform (Lute)\">Perform (Lute)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Peculiar_Clothing_Chest\" title=\"Peculiar Clothing Chest\">Peculiar Clothing Chest</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Traveller%27s_Chest\" title=\"Traveller's Chest\">Traveller's Chest</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Campsite\" title=\"Campsite\">Campsite</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Lute of the Merryweather Bard is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_References\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cultural References\">reference</a> to <i>Divinity: Original Sin II</i>, inspired by the character Lohse.</li>\n<li>This item is exclusive to the <a href=\"/wiki/Digital_Deluxe_Upgrade\" title=\"Digital Deluxe Upgrade\">Digital Deluxe Upgrade</a>, alongside other cosmetic items themed around <i>Divinity: Original Sin II</i>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"In-Game_Performance\">In-Game Performance</span></h2>\n<center>\n<figure class=\"embedvideo\" data-service=\"youtube\" data-mw-iframeconfig=\"{&quot;width&quot;:400,&quot;height&quot;:225,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/_vLTaJJfPjA?autoplay=1&quot;}\" style=\"width:400px\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper\" style=\"height:225px\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-consent\" data-show-privacy-notice=\"1\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Load video</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">YouTube</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice hidden\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__content\">YouTube might collect personal data. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/howyoutubeworks/user-settings/privacy/\" rel=\"nofollow,noopener\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__link\">Privacy Policy</a></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__buttons\">\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__continue\">Continue<